Senator Risa Hontiveros: It is not yet a livelihood restored.

asr-000052
00:14:45.200 --> 00:14:49.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: It is not yet relief reaching a family in crisis.

asr-000053
00:14:50.280 --> 00:14:51.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ang tunay na sukatin,

asr-000054
00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:53.180
