00:19:57.820 --> 00:19:59.260
RestoPH President David Sison: conversations namin with NCDA,

asr-000201
00:19:59.500 --> 00:20:01.800
RestoPH President David Sison: with DOH, and sa mga nakita namin

asr-000202
00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:03.640
RestoPH President David Sison: online, napakadali po kasi

asr-000203
00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:06.120
RestoPH President David Sison: na bumili ng PWD

asr-000204
00:20:06.120 --> 00:20:07.900
RestoPH President David Sison: online na peke.

asr-000205
00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:09.320
RestoPH President David Sison: So doon kami na alarma.

asr-000206
00:20:09.560 --> 00:20:11.760
RestoPH President David Sison: Ang verification process natin is

asr-000207
00:20:11.760 --> 00:20:13.640
RestoPH President David Sison: nagagaling lang sa website

asr-000208
00:20:13.640 --> 00:20:14.940
RestoPH President David Sison: galing sa Department of Health.

asr-000209
00:20:15.540 --> 00:20:18.000
RestoPH President David Sison: Yung website na yun is hindi updated

asr-000210
00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.860
RestoPH President David Sison: dahil ang nagbibigay

asr-000211
00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:21.960
RestoPH President David Sison: ng PWD ID natin is

asr-000212
00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.440
RestoPH President David Sison: the LGU.

asr-000213
00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:25.560
RestoPH President David Sison: We have more than 2,500

asr-000214
00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.620
RestoPH President David Sison: LGUs dito. And iba-iba

asr-000215
00:20:27.820 --> 00:20:29.740
RestoPH President David Sison: yung disenyo ng bawat ID.

asr-000216
00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.980
RestoPH President David Sison: Nagbigay ng statement yung Department of Justice

asr-000217
00:20:31.980 --> 00:20:33.660
RestoPH President David Sison: na nagulat sila na meron palang

asr-000218
00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.580
RestoPH President David Sison: 6 million na fake

asr-000219
00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.940
RestoPH President David Sison: PWD IDs.

asr-000220
00:20:37.400 --> 00:20:40.160
RestoPH President David Sison: And mas malaki pa yung nawawalang pera

asr-000221
00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.920
RestoPH President David Sison: sa mga restaurant owners

asr-000222
00:20:41.920 --> 00:20:44.020
RestoPH President David Sison: because of the fake na lumalaganap.

asr-000223
00:20:44.360 --> 00:20:46.080
RestoPH President David Sison: May mga restaurants na maliliit

asr-000224
00:20:46.080 --> 00:20:47.120
RestoPH President David Sison: lang, hindi ganong kalaki.

asr-000225
00:20:47.380 --> 00:20:49.840
RestoPH President David Sison: Lahat ng mga margin na pwede nilang isave,

asr-000226
00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.620
RestoPH President David Sison: magagamit nila. Pero syempre kung

asr-000227
00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.100
RestoPH President David Sison: napupunta lang ito sa mga fake

asr-000228
00:20:53.100 --> 00:20:55.940
RestoPH President David Sison: na cards, sa fake na

asr-000229
00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.540
RestoPH President David Sison: discount, kawawa naman.

asr-000230
00:20:57.820 --> 00:20:59.300
RestoPH President David Sison: Yan ang pinaglalaban natin.

asr-000231
00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.200
RestoPH President David Sison: Kasi sila talaga yung araw-araw

asr-000232
00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:04.920
RestoPH President David Sison: na magsusurvive lang.

asr-000233
00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:06.300
RestoPH President David Sison: Dapat mayroon tayong

asr-000234
00:21:06.300 --> 00:21:08.320
RestoPH President David Sison: batas that would really

asr-000235
00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.060
RestoPH President David Sison: napoprotektahan talaga yung

asr-000236
00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:11.760
RestoPH President David Sison: PWD natin.

asr-000237
00:21:12.640 --> 00:21:14.360
RestoPH President David Sison: Yung tunay na PWD.

asr-000238
00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.720
RestoPH President David Sison: Araw-araw na nag-ooperate

asr-000239
00:21:16.720 --> 00:21:17.900
RestoPH President David Sison: ang tindahan.

asr-000240
00:21:18.220 --> 00:21:19.920
RestoPH President David Sison: Araw-araw na

asr-000241
00:21:19.920 --> 00:21:22.200
RestoPH President David Sison: nakakalusot ang mga peke

asr-000242
00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:22.980
RestoPH President David Sison: yung gumagamit.

asr-000243
00:21:27.820 --> 00:21:29.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Selling of fake PWDs

asr-000244
00:21:29.560 --> 00:21:31.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ay talamak na rin sa research

asr-000245
00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:32.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na ginawa ng aking mga staff.

asr-000246
00:21:33.460 --> 00:21:35.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mayroon din mga accounts sa Carousel

asr-000247
00:21:35.600 --> 00:21:37.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at Facebook na nag-offer ng

asr-000248
00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:38.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: PWD ID.

asr-000249
00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron pang package.

asr-000250
00:21:42.300 --> 00:21:43.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Yung iba pa nga

asr-000251
00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:45.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ay may kasama pang booklets.

asr-000252
00:21:47.040 --> 00:21:47.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pwede natin pakita yung

asr-000253
00:21:47.780 --> 00:21:49.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: slides. Ayan po.

asr-000254
00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.000
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Talamak ang bendahan ng mga

asr-000255
00:21:51.000 --> 00:21:52.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: PWD IDs

asr-000256
00:21:52.460 --> 00:21:54.440
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sa Facebook.

asr-000257
00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Anong ginagawa ng

asr-000258
00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:58.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: NCDA?

asr-000259
00:22:00.220 --> 00:22:01.880
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ito pong masaklap, Madam Chair.

asr-000260
00:22:03.060 --> 00:22:03.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming kakilala

asr-000261
00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:06.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na pagkalaki-laki

asr-000262
00:22:06.020 --> 00:22:06.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng katawan,

asr-000263
00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:08.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: tambay sa basketball

asr-000264
00:22:08.760 --> 00:22:11.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at meron siyang PWD ID.

asr-000265
00:22:12.060 --> 00:22:13.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Lalaaki ito. Tinanong ko siya, pare,

asr-000266
00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:15.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ba't meron kang PWD ID?

asr-000267
00:22:16.200 --> 00:22:17.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ano yung kapansana mo?

asr-000268
00:22:17.700 --> 00:22:18.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi, psychosocial ako.

asr-000269
00:22:19.300 --> 00:22:21.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Totoo yan. Napakarami

asr-000270
00:22:21.500 --> 00:22:22.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mga tao ang lalaki ng katawan

asr-000271
00:22:22.960 --> 00:22:25.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: may mga magagandang trabaho

asr-000272
00:22:25.300 --> 00:22:26.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and yet may PWD ID.

asr-000273
00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:27.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano?

asr-000274
00:22:27.120 --> 00:22:27.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mga kalusot mga ito.

asr-000275
00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:30.020
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Of course, walang problema sa akin

asr-000276
00:22:30.020 --> 00:22:31.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kung talagang tunay na may kapansanan.

asr-000277
00:22:31.920 --> 00:22:33.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Siguro it's time na we have to define

asr-000278
00:22:33.720 --> 00:22:34.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ano ba talaga

asr-000279
00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:38.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang mga requirements bago makatanggap

asr-000280
00:22:38.360 --> 00:22:39.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng PWD ID ang isang tao.

asr-000281
00:22:40.320 --> 00:22:41.560
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Anong klaseng makapansanan?

asr-000282
00:22:41.700 --> 00:22:44.320
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi halos lahat mga kilala ko

asr-000283
00:22:44.320 --> 00:22:47.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na may PWD ID na ang lalaki ng katawan

asr-000284
00:22:47.100 --> 00:22:49.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: nakalagay doon psychosocial.

asr-000285
00:22:50.700 --> 00:22:51.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron pa nga sabi ko,

asr-000286
00:22:51.580 --> 00:22:53.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ba't ka merong PWD ID?

asr-000287
00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:54.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi may sinusitis ako eh.

asr-000288
00:22:54.680 --> 00:22:56.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: At binigyan ng doktor.

asr-000289
00:22:57.120 --> 00:22:58.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Meron pa ako alam, basketballista.

asr-000290
00:22:59.720 --> 00:23:01.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Mga basketball player, Madam Chair,

asr-000291
00:23:02.000 --> 00:23:03.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: medyo nabalian lang.

asr-000292
00:23:04.300 --> 00:23:05.040
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pupunta ng hospital.

asr-000293
00:23:05.180 --> 00:23:06.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: O, pera ng doktor.

asr-000294
00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:07.620
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Gusto mo, bigyan kita ang PWD ID.

asr-000295
00:23:07.760 --> 00:23:08.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sige, bigyan.

asr-000296
00:23:08.760 --> 00:23:09.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: And then permanently,

asr-000297
00:23:10.040 --> 00:23:11.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: permanent na yung PWD ID.

asr-000298
00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:16.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Naabuso po yung PWD ID

asr-000299
00:23:16.060 --> 00:23:17.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at ang kawawa po dito

asr-000300
00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:19.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: yung mga malilit na tindahan,

asr-000301
00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:20.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: restaurant.

asr-000302
00:23:20.300 --> 00:23:23.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Saan ka nakikita yung isang tao

asr-000303
00:23:23.220 --> 00:23:25.120
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na magandang trabaho,

asr-000304
00:23:26.120 --> 00:23:26.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: malaking katawan,

asr-000305
00:23:27.120 --> 00:23:28.580
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: o punta sa restaurant

asr-000306
00:23:28.580 --> 00:23:29.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: o order ng lobster, crabs,

asr-000307
00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:31.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: para makuha ng 20%.

asr-000308
00:23:31.980 --> 00:23:33.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Tapos niya naakit sa hotel,

asr-000309
00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:33.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mag-check-in,

asr-000310
00:23:34.160 --> 00:23:34.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: 20% na naman.

asr-000311
00:23:35.340 --> 00:23:37.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Naabuso po talaga itong PWD ID

asr-000312
00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:39.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at ang nakikita kong problema rito,

asr-000313
00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:40.420
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: siguro from now on,

asr-000314
00:23:40.900 --> 00:23:43.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: meron kasi mga PWD ID na legit.

asr-000315
00:23:45.540 --> 00:23:48.740
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero fake naman yung cardholder.

asr-000316
00:23:49.380 --> 00:23:50.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala naman talagang sakit.

asr-000317
00:23:50.960 --> 00:23:53.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero mas marami yung fake na PWD ID.

asr-000318
00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:56.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: It's about time that we have to address this issue

asr-000319
00:23:56.060 --> 00:23:59.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na para naman mabawasan yung pamimaking ng PWD ID

asr-000320
00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:02.400
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: at mabigyan yung karapat-dapat talaga

asr-000321
00:24:02.400 --> 00:24:05.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na mga taong may kapansanan.

asr-000322
00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:08.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Kasi ang premise naman talaga ng batas

asr-000323
00:24:08.160 --> 00:24:12.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kaya nagkaroon tayo ng discount sa mga PWDs

asr-000324
00:24:12.060 --> 00:24:14.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ay sila ay matulungan,

asr-000325
00:24:15.020 --> 00:24:16.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: mapagaan yung kanilang kalagayan

asr-000326
00:24:16.800 --> 00:24:19.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and most of them walang trabaho,

asr-000327
00:24:19.580 --> 00:24:20.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: hindi makapagtrabaho.

asr-000328
00:24:20.760 --> 00:24:22.380
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Makapagtrabaho man, part-time lang

asr-000329
00:24:22.380 --> 00:24:25.980
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and then malaking gastusin sa gamot.

asr-000330
00:24:26.060 --> 00:24:30.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Pero paano itong mga taong alam ko

asr-000331
00:24:30.260 --> 00:24:33.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: may mga trabaho above minimum

asr-000332
00:24:33.520 --> 00:24:34.700
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang lalaki ng katawan

asr-000333
00:24:34.700 --> 00:24:38.480
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and yet nagkakaroon ng fake PWD IDs?

asr-000334
00:24:38.940 --> 00:24:41.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Ang tanong nasa National Center for Disability Affairs

asr-000335
00:24:41.760 --> 00:24:44.100
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: kayong hensyang natasang siguraduhin

asr-000336
00:24:44.100 --> 00:24:46.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: maayos ang implementasyon ng lahat ng batas

asr-000337
00:24:46.180 --> 00:24:47.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: patungkol sa PWDs

asr-000338
00:24:47.500 --> 00:24:49.920
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: pero mga inutil kayo.

asr-000339
00:24:50.700 --> 00:24:52.200
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Sobrang inutil as a matter of fact.

asr-000340
00:24:53.000 --> 00:24:54.260
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit umabot sa katakot-takot

asr-000341
00:24:54.260 --> 00:24:55.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na 6 million ng mga faking IDs?

asr-000342
00:24:56.060 --> 00:24:57.680
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Paano nakalusot ito?

asr-000343
00:24:58.520 --> 00:24:59.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala ba kayong koordinasyon

asr-000344
00:24:59.800 --> 00:25:01.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: with other agencies at sa LGUs?

asr-000345
00:25:02.500 --> 00:25:03.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Wala ba kayong ngipin

asr-000346
00:25:03.860 --> 00:25:05.960
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: upang masigurang implementasyon ng batas?

asr-000347
00:25:06.600 --> 00:25:07.800
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Bakit wala kayong kakayahan

asr-000348
00:25:07.800 --> 00:25:10.460
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na imonitor ang problemang ito

asr-000349
00:25:10.460 --> 00:25:12.900
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: na nagsimula pa noong pandemic?

asr-000350
00:25:13.780 --> 00:25:14.220
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Madam Chair,

asr-000351
00:25:14.600 --> 00:25:16.160
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: my purpose is to uphold the rights

asr-000352
00:25:16.160 --> 00:25:18.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and protect persons with disabilities

asr-000353
00:25:18.080 --> 00:25:20.140
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: not to discredit them.

asr-000354
00:25:21.320 --> 00:25:23.080
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Nais kumatsyak na matatanggap

asr-000355
00:25:23.080 --> 00:25:24.520
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ng mga liitimong PWD

asr-000356
00:25:24.520 --> 00:25:25.940
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang mga binipisyong

asr-000357
00:25:25.940 --> 00:25:27.640
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: itinakda ng batas.

asr-000358
00:25:28.220 --> 00:25:29.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Hindi makatarungan maging dahilan

asr-000359
00:25:29.540 --> 00:25:31.360
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang pamemeke ng mga scammer

asr-000360
00:25:31.360 --> 00:25:34.600
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: upang pagdudahan ang pagbibigay ng diskwento

asr-000361
00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:36.540
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: sa mga tunay na nangangailangan nito.

asr-000362
00:25:37.260 --> 00:25:38.840
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: We may also need to review

asr-000363
00:25:38.840 --> 00:25:40.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: existing laws to clarify

asr-000364
00:25:40.760 --> 00:25:42.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: which disabilities

asr-000365
00:25:42.720 --> 00:25:45.180
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: qualify for government benefits.

asr-000366
00:25:46.060 --> 00:25:47.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: These benefits are grounded

asr-000367
00:25:47.060 --> 00:25:48.300
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: in social justice

asr-000368
00:25:48.300 --> 00:25:49.820
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: and the Philippine Constitution

asr-000369
00:25:49.820 --> 00:25:51.760
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: which affirms the dignity

asr-000370
00:25:51.760 --> 00:25:54.280
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: of every person and guarantees

asr-000371
00:25:54.280 --> 00:25:55.780
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: full respect for human rights.

asr-000372
00:25:55.940 --> 00:25:58.060
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Huwag nating gamitin sa kalokohan

asr-000373
00:25:58.060 --> 00:25:59.720
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: ang talagayan ng ating mga kababayang

asr-000374
00:25:59.720 --> 00:26:00.860
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: may kapansanan.

asr-000375
00:26:02.100 --> 00:26:03.500
Senator Raffy T. Tulfo: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair.

asr-000376
00:26:04.060 --> 00:26:05.320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Maraming salamat din po,

asr-000377
00:26:05.660 --> 00:26:06.480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Senator Rafi.

asr-000378
00:26:06.800 --> 00:26:07.620
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Secretary Rex,

asr-000379
00:26:07.780 --> 00:26:10.640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I'm sure you will touch on this

asr-000380
00:26:10.640 --> 00:26:11.700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa presentation nyo

asr-000381
00:26:11.700 --> 00:26:14.660
Senator Risa Hontiveros: including in relation to DOJ,

asr-000382
00:26:14.800 --> 00:26:15.600
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Department of Health,

asr-000383
00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:17.200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: and the LGUs na binanggit din po

asr-000384
00:26:17.200 --> 00:26:19.860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: sa pag-raise nitong importanteng isyong ito.

asr-000385
