Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: tila kulang pa,

asr-000430
00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:41.740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: may paparating po tayo na El Niño,

asr-000431
00:27:42.680 --> 00:27:43.620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hindi pa tapos ang

asr-000432
