asr-000437
00:27:54.420 --> 00:27:55.440
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sasapat

asr-000438
00:27:55.440 --> 00:27:56.520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ba ang pondo nila

asr-000439
00:27:56.520 --> 00:27:57.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: para sa ika nga

asr-000440
00:27:57.480 --> 00:27:59.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: mga paparating na emergency.

