Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ay may kaaktibat

asr-000455
00:28:17.700 --> 00:28:19.180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na pananagutan at resulta.

asr-000456
00:28:20.120 --> 00:28:21.020
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Are our resources

asr-000457
00:28:21.020 --> 00:28:22.460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: reaching the right beneficiaries

asr-000458
00:28:22.460 --> 00:28:23.620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: at the right time

asr-000459
00:28:23.620 --> 00:28:24.840
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and in the right amount?

