Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: in the Pantawid Pamilyang Pilipino Program,

asr-000467
00:28:35.700 --> 00:28:36.560
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: social pension,

asr-000468
00:28:36.720 --> 00:28:38.360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and sustainable livelihood programs

asr-000469
00:28:38.360 --> 00:28:40.260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sufficient to help beneficiaries

asr-000470
00:28:40.260 --> 00:28:42.260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: achieve lasting improvements

asr-000471
00:28:42.260 --> 00:28:43.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: in their lives?

asr-000472
00:28:43.860 --> 00:28:45.100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ang bawat piso nilaan po

asr-000473
00:28:45.100 --> 00:28:46.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa DSWD

asr-000474
00:28:46.060 --> 00:28:47.120
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: ay dapat may katumbas

asr-000475
00:28:47.120 --> 00:28:48.160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: na tunay na tulong,

asr-000476
