Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: malinaw na pananagutan

asr-000477
00:28:49.880 --> 00:28:51.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: at kongkretong pagbabago

asr-000478
00:28:51.140 --> 00:28:52.620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: sa buhay ng ating mga kababayan.

asr-000479
00:28:53.400 --> 00:28:55.020
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: As we scrutinize this budget,

asr-000480
00:28:55.020 --> 00:28:56.140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: our focus will be

asr-000481
00:28:56.140 --> 00:28:57.960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: on resolving critical operational

