00:29:10.020 --> 00:29:12.060
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: whose funding and targeted beneficiaries

asr-000488
00:29:12.060 --> 00:29:14.340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: have been substantially reduced.

asr-000489
00:29:15.060 --> 00:29:16.480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: We will look into the status

asr-000490
00:29:16.480 --> 00:29:17.280
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: of four P's

asr-000491
00:29:17.280 --> 00:29:18.800
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: under recent policy adjustment,

asr-000492
00:29:19.140 --> 00:29:21.680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: as well as the social pension program,

asr-000493
00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:23.400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: where over half a million

asr-000494
00:29:23.400 --> 00:29:25.000
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: eligible indigent seniors

asr-000495
00:29:25.020 --> 00:29:27.420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: and citizens remain wait-listed

