asr-004311
02:58:16.320 --> 02:58:21.340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nung 2024, nag-sunset na yung Kalahi.

asr-004312
02:58:21.640 --> 02:58:23.260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Basically, ang programa nun.

asr-004313
