DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Normally, they're in the farthest, poorest provinces or municipalities that otherwise hindi mapapansin ng ga'a.

asr-004315
02:58:35.780 --> 02:58:37.720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi ang layo nila, nasa liblib na lugar.

asr-004316
02:58:38.420 --> 02:58:42.800
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang ginagawa ko dyan, the community identifies, parang bottom-up budgeting yan.

asr-004317
