DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The community identifies the project that they need.

asr-004318
02:58:46.160 --> 02:58:51.500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then those sub-projects normally don't go beyond 20 million on a three-year scale.

asr-004319
