asr-004327
02:59:23.260 --> 02:59:25.580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang tatamano dyan yung community grants nila.

asr-004328
02:59:25.860 --> 02:59:32.700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meaning, lesser sub-projects, itong mga pre-identified na targets, hindi hun lahat mabibigyan.

asr-004329
